---
output: preproc, svg
---
@startuml
' EXPECT (preproc): the years 1 to 9999 only: a timestamp out of them is an OverflowError (CPython goes further)
' title OverflowError OverflowError ValueError
!r = []
!for s in [253402300800.0, -62135596801.0]:
!    try:
!        time.gmtime(s)
!    except OverflowError:
!        r.append('OverflowError')
!try:
!    time.strftime('%Y', (2026, 13, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0))
!except ValueError:
!    r.append('ValueError')
title !{' '.join(r)}
@enduml
